<title>USA: Semiconductor Packaging Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Semiconductor Packaging Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MAMARONECK, N.Y. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semiconductor Packaging Materials Co., Inc. and Subsidiaries</p>
<p>			  Consolidated Statement of Income</p>
<p>			  (Unaudited)</p>
<p>			  For The Three Months  For The Nine Months</p>
<p>			   Ended September 30,  Ended September 30,</p>
<p>			   1996	 1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Revenue	  11,946,373  7,002,455  35,436,437  20,121,873</p>
<p>Cost of Goods Sold</p>
<p>and Services Performed</p>
<p>		     7,735,133  4,334,702  23,207,192  12,245,466</p>
<p> Gross Profit    4,211,240  2,667,753  12,229,245   7,876,407</p>
<p>Selling, General and</p>
<p>Administrative Expenses</p>
<p>		     1,995,643  1,605,361   5,816,359   4,800,518</p>
<p>Operating Income</p>
<p>		     2,215,597  1,062,392   6,412,886   3,075,889</p>
<p>Interest Expense (Net)</p>
<p>			 234,331    159,074     653,536     929,529</p>
<p>Income Before Provision</p>
<p>for Income Taxes</p>
<p>		     1,981,266    903,318   5,759,350   2,146,360</p>
<p>Provision for Income</p>
<p>  Taxes		717,470    206,912   2,233,401     456,763</p>
<p> Net Income     $1,263,796   $696,406  $3,525,949  $1,689,597</p>
<p>Income per</p>
<p>  Common Share (A)    0.21	 0.13	  0.57	  0.36</p>
<p>Weighted Average Number</p>
<p>of Common Shares</p>
<p>  Outstanding    6,156,671  5,529,272   6,145,586   4,745,754</p>
<p>(A) All earnings per share amounts assume full dilution.  Earnings per share has been computed on a weighted average number of common shares and common stock equivalents outstanding. SOURCE  Semiconductor Packaging Materials Co., Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
